course: dictionary
lesson: 9247
title: Words that show deep feeling
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: «Sorrowful» means full of great sadness. It is a stronger, more literary word than «sad», so writers choose it when they want a feeling to sound deep.
explain: Read this sentence: «But the Rat thinks he sees a twinkle in Toad's sorrowful eye.» The word eye is your clue. A sorrowful eye looks sad and full of feeling. Try swapping in «sad»: it still makes sense, but «sorrowful» tells you the sadness is deep.
explain: The word can also mean causing sadness, as in sorrowful music or a sorrowful poem. Its adverb is «sorrowfully», which tells you how someone does something, like sighing sorrowfully.
fact: Sorrowful means feeling or showing great sadness.
fact: Sorrowful can also mean causing sadness, as in sorrowful music.
fact: The adverb sorrowfully means in a sad way, as in «She spoke sorrowfully about her lost dog.»
fact: «Sorrowful» is more literary than «sad», so you will often see it in stories and poems.
fact: In church, the Sorrowful Mysteries are prayers Catholics say about Jesus's suffering.
exercise: «But the Rat thinks he sees a twinkle in Toad's sorrowful eye.» What does sorrowful mean here? | Angry and loud | *Full of great sadness | Bright and cheerful | Sleepy and tired
exercise: A teacher says a poem is sorrowful. What might she mean? | A poem with no words at all | A very short poem | A poem that makes people feel sad | *A poem that makes people feel sad, deeply, when they hear it
exercise: Find the adverb in «She spoke sorrowfully about her lost dog.» Which word is it? | quietly | *sorrowfully | loudly | happily
test: Which word means nearly the same as sorrowful? | Cheerful | Silly | *Grieving | Giggly
test: Why might a writer choose sorrowful instead of sad? | Because sorrowful means happy | Because sad is a rude word | Because it is shorter | *To sound more literary and show deep feeling
exam: Which sentence uses sorrowful correctly? | We walked sorrowful to the shop | *The sorrowful song made the whole hall go quiet | Sorrowful is a kind of fruit we eat at lunch | The sorrowful puppy wagged its tail with joy
